{"text": "Near the Hudson River, there was a small, quiet valley where everything seemed to move in a dream. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> People called it Sleepy Hollow, and they said that a drowsy, dreamy spirit hung over the whole land. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The people there loved strange stories, and they often saw odd sights and heard music in the air. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The most famous ghost of the valley was a rider on horseback who had no head at all. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Some said he was the ghost of a soldier who had lost his head to a cannonball in the war. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Every night, people said, he rode out to the old battlefield, searching for his lost head. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His body was said to lie in the churchyard, so he always hurried back there before daybreak. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In this valley lived a schoolteacher named Ichabod Crane, who had come from Connecticut to teach the local children. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was tall and very thin, with long arms, huge ears, and a long nose like a birds beak. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Seeing him walk across a hill on a windy day, you might take him for a scarecrow.", "alignment": {"characters": ["N", "e", "a", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "H", "u", "d", "s", "o", "n", " ", "R", "i", "v", "e", "r", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "s", "m", "a", "l", "l", ",", " ", "q", "u", "i", "e", "t", " ", "v", "a", "l", "l", "e", "y", " ", "w", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "e", "v", "e", "r", "y", "t", "h", "i", "n", "g", " ", "s", "e", "e", "m", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "m", "o", "v", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", " ", "d", "r", "e", "a", "m", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "P", "e", "o", "p", "l", "e", " ", "c", "a", "l", "l", "e", "d", " ", "i", "t", " ", "S", "l", "e", "e", "p", "y", " ", "H", "o", "l", "l", "o", "w", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "